  "body": "At the CSSWG, there was a resolution (on issue https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/8542#issuecomment-1515216159)  to update the resize observer steps in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#processing-model-8 to admit updates other than resize observation broadcast into the loop that repeats style & layout.\r\n\r\nCSSWG resolutions don't affect HTML directly, but I wanted to note it regardless.\r\n\r\nThe reason this was in CSSWG is that the context of the issue started as a problem with the css-contain-2 spec describing timing of content visibility. It seems that the best solution would be to directly update this loop.\r\n\r\nThis issue is to track the discussion and any PRs that implement the resolution.\r\n\r\nLet me know if anyone has any concerns or feedback.\r\n\r\n/cc @foolip @chrishtr @emilio \r\n\r\n",
